    const-string v0, ".\n            A disabled permission is a hard block. Do not bypass it with another tool or with shell commands. write covers create/edit/update/copy, move covers move/cut/rename, delete covers deletion, chmod covers POSIX permission changes, terminal controls run_command/build_apk/terminal_snapshot, adb controls wireless ADB device bridge execution, and ssh controls Git remote pushes and SSH deployment.\n            Terminal Runner is "

